Recovery reasoning: Exact partition: 9,610 - 2,143 = 7,467 SSE-S3 objects replicated fine; every SSE-KMS object failed. Grant decrypt, then re-drive the backlog — replication never retries FAILED objects; Batch Replication exists for that.
<|call:aws_kms_put_key_policy|> {"key_id": "ledger-src-cmk", "add_statement": {"principal": "role/s3-crr-role", "actions": ["kms:Decrypt"]}}
