Resolution: us-west-2 replica holds 9,610/9,610 objects; job report = compliance evidence. Root cause: replication role lacked kms:Decrypt on the new source CMK, failing exactly the 2,143 SSE-KMS objects while the rule reported Enabled.

Reasoning: A cross-account 403 starting exactly at our change window suggests something we flipped. Quantify from CloudTrail first.
